    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7814064D2E2A85287171A35EBB8D8760" xlink:label="HH7814064D2E2A85287171A35EBB8D8760" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHDD3B8E4E54C6EC5C8AF5746255BA8069" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Unitil Service Corp. (&#8220;USC&#8221;) provides shared administrative and professional services for its Unitil affiliates, in accordance with Service Agreements with each affiliate company. The costs of the services are accumulated in designated USC accounts and are assigned on a direct or cost-causation basis whenever possible, or allocated to the appropriate affiliate in accordance with guidelines provided. Time for work performed by USC employees for the Utility Client Companies is recorded by functional Job Order Number and charged to the Utility Client Companies. USC costs that are considered general overhead in nature are charged to the Utility Client Companies in relation to the direct time charged.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
